出てしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母とは折り合いが悪く、いつかは店を自分の物にしたいという野心を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"▽好きな食べ物：魚介系料理（魚、貝、エビなど）、紅茶"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"▽使用武器：GSL-99「シャルロット」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"GS社製グレネードランチャー。「シャルロットちゃん」と呼んで愛用中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他にも様々な炸薬系兵器をスカートの中に隠し持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"101103"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"birthday":[{"comparisonValue":"0506","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c100121","value":"506"},{"comparisonValue":"0405","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23771","value":"4/5"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/39f4a25a67e9e743f43878c80394849d7a46797ee0a74362ca678899f6b3eeae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88e08bbd7853e6462e0feafea1595f4f4b3b91c261d3bd316c8dcf38cf7c37ef.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田茜","creatorId":"vndb:s8737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8737","name":"藤田 茜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:349037:101103:17981:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c100122","characterName":"デスペラード","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"101104","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"349037"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23772"],"vndbCharacterId":"c100122"},"originalCharacterName":"デスペラード","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"egs","value":"6/13"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Thug and genius gunner who is feared by everyone in the slums of Eleutheria. She first meets the protagonist when she tries to extort money from him only to get surprised by h